# NeuralPhish AI Environment Configuration
#
# SINGLE-SERVICE PRODUCTION DEPLOYMENT:
# No environment variables are required. The FastAPI backend serves both the
# React frontend and API routes on the same host and port.
#
# LOCAL DEVELOPMENT (OPTIONAL):
# In development mode, Vite dev server automatically proxies /predict to http://localhost:8000.
# Only specify VITE_API_BASE_URL if your backend is running on a different custom host/port.
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
# PORT=8000
